0.08 0.28 0.52 RG 1.20 w 40.0 714.5 m 572.0 714.5 l S
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.10 0.10 rg 40.0 705.5 Td (All commands are executed from the project root in your VS Code terminal:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 40.0 692.5 Td (Path: e:\\mohini's program\\.vscode\\acoustic_epidermiology) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 676.0 Td (Check 1: Live Model Verification & Breath Simulation) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.42 0.22 rg 40.0 663.0 Td (   Command: python "Cnn model\\check_model.py") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 40.0 651.0 Td (   What it does: Loads the saved .keras model, checks all 102,019 parameters, simulates an 8,000 Hz child breath sound, preprocesses into a 128x128 tensor, runs forward inference, and prints predicted condition with confidence score.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 637.5 Td (Check 2: Print Official Team Evaluation Tables) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.42 0.22 rg 40.0 624.5 Td (   Command: python "Cnn model\\print_evaluation_results.py") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 40.0 612.5 Td (   What it does: Reads sprsound-disease-cnn-v1-fold0_eval.json and prints the exact precision, recall, F1, and confusion matrix tables for team reports.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 599.0 Td (Check 3: Run Unit & Integration Test Suite) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.42 0.22 rg 40.0 586.0 Td (   Command: python "Cnn model\\test_cnn_pipeline.py") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 40.0 574.0 Td (   What it does: Executes 6 automated tests: audio loading, Butterworth bandpass filter, Mel normalization, tensor dimensions, zero patient leakage, and TensorFlow compliance. \(Outputs: Ran 6 tests ... OK\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 560.5 Td (Check 4: Verify Trained Model Artifacts on Disk) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.42 0.22 rg 40.0 547.5 Td (   Command: Get-ChildItem "Cnn model\\saved_models", "ml\\models\\saved_models" -Filter "*.keras") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 40.0 535.5 Td (   What it does: Confirms the physical existence and 1.24 MB file size of sprsound-disease-cnn-v1-fold0.keras in both local and backend storage folders.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 522.0 Td (Command 5: Classify Any Child's Breath Recording \(.wav\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.42 0.22 rg 40.0 509.0 Td (   Command: python "Cnn model\\predict.py" --audio "path\\to\\child_breath.wav" --task disease) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 40.0 497.0 Td (   What it does: Submits a real breath recording, preprocesses into a spectrogram, and outputs disease prediction \(Healthy Control, Pneumonia, Wheezing Disorders\) with confidence percentages.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 483.5 Td (Command 6: Train CNN Model from Scratch) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.42 0.22 rg 40.0 470.5 Td (   Command: python "Cnn model\\train.py" --task disease --val-fold 0 --epochs 50 --batch-size 32) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 40.0 458.5 Td (   What it does: Runs full patient-disjoint training with SpecAugment data augmentation, early stopping, and automatic checkpointing to .keras format.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 445.0 Td (Command 7: Connect & Register Model with Gayatri's Django Backend) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.12 0.42 0.22 rg 40.0 432.0 Td (   Command: python "Cnn model\\backend_sync.py" --task disease) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 40.0 420.0 Td (   What it does: Registers the model in the Django database, sets it to ACTIVE, and eliminates HTTP 503 errors on backend prediction endpoints.) Tj ET

