BT /F2 13.0 Tf 0.08 0.28 0.52 rg 40.0 729.0 Td (4. File Breakdown: What Every File Does & Key Functions) Tj ET
0.08 0.28 0.52 RG 1.20 w 40.0 714.5 m 572.0 714.5 l S
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.10 0.10 rg 40.0 705.5 Td (Detailed guide to all files and important functions inside the 'Cnn model/' package:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 688.5 Td (File: config.py -- Central Configuration & Acoustic Settings) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 675.5 Td (   * DISEASE_CLASSES: List of 3 verified disease labels \('Healthy Control', 'Pneumonia', 'Wheezing Disorders'\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 664.0 Td (   * PREPROCESSING_CONFIG: Dict defining 8kHz sample rate, n_mels=128, n_fft=1024, hop=512, Butterworth 50-2000Hz.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 652.5 Td (   * CNN_INPUT_SHAPE: Tuple \(128, 128, 1\) defining the 2D tensor input shape required by the backend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 641.0 Td (   * TARGET_CONV_LAYER_NAME: String 'last_conv_layer' required for Grad-CAM backpropagation hook.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 626.5 Td (File: preprocessor.py -- Acoustic Feature Extraction Pipeline) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 613.5 Td (   * load_audio\(path, target_sr\): Reads .wav file via soundfile/scipy/wave, averages stereo to mono, resamples to 8000 Hz.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 602.0 Td (   * apply_butterworth_bandpass\(audio\): Applies zero-phase 5th-order Butterworth filter \(50-2000 Hz\) to isolate breath sounds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 590.5 Td (   * compute_mel_spectrogram\(audio\): Extracts 128 Mel bands, scales to dB, applies minmax_01 normalization [0.0, 1.0].) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 579.0 Td (   * prepare_cnn_input\(audio_path\): End-to-end pipeline returning standardized \(1, 128, 128, 1\) float32 tensor.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 564.5 Td (File: architecture.py -- Convolutional Neural Network Topologies) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 551.5 Td (   * build_throat_disease_cnn\(\): Builds 3-block 2D-CNN with Conv2D\(32\), Conv2D\(64\), Conv2D\(128, name='last_conv_layer'\), GAP, Dense\(3\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 540.0 Td (   * build_throat_sound_cnn\(\): Builds 4-block 2D-CNN for adventitious sound classification \(Normal, CAS, DAS, CAS&DAS, Stridor\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 528.5 Td (   * verify_model_for_backend\(model\): Validates input/output shapes, non-NaN outputs, and presence of 'last_conv_layer'.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 514.0 Td (File: dataset_loader.py -- Patient-Grouped Data Loading & Augmentation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 501.0 Td (   * load_disease_dataset\(val_fold\): Loads .npz features from disease manifest, checks patient disjointness, computes balanced weights.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 489.5 Td (   * augment_spectrogram\(tensor\): Applies SpecAugment: random frequency masking, time masking, and subtle Gaussian noise.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 475.0 Td (File: train.py -- End-to-End Training & Checkpointing Engine) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 462.0 Td (   * train_model\(task, val_fold, epochs\): Manages training with Adam, EarlyStopping, ReduceLROnPlateau, ModelCheckpoint.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 450.5 Td (   * Export Logic: Automatically copies trained .keras file to ml/models/saved_models/ for backend compliance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 436.0 Td (File: predict.py -- Child Breath Audio Inference Engine) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 423.0 Td (   * predict_breath_audio\(audio_path\): Accepts child breath .wav, preprocesses to 128x128x1, runs forward pass, returns disease probabilities.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 411.5 Td (   * print_prediction_report\(res\): Formats inference output into clean ASCII table with probability progress bars.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 397.0 Td (File: explain_gradcam.py -- Grad-CAM Saliency & Interpretability) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 384.0 Td (   * generate_gradcam_heatmap\(model\): Computes gradient of predicted class wrt last_conv_layer, produces 2D attention heatmap.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 372.5 Td (   * save_gradcam_visualization\(\): Renders 3-panel figure: Mel-Spectrogram, Grad-CAM heatmap overlay, and breath cycle profile.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.10 0.25 0.45 rg 40.0 358.0 Td (File: backend_sync.py -- Django Backend Registration Bridge) Tj ET
